---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="RM Search — Google Ads for clinics | RM CREATIVES" description="Capture existing patient demand with Google Ads. We assess search demand and economics before launch, then build campaigns around real patient intent.">
<main>
<section class="hero shell"><div class="eyebrow top"><span>RM / PRODUCT 02</span><span>GOOGLE ADS / EXISTING DEMAND</span></div><div class="hero-grid"><h1>Don't create<br/>demand.<br/><em>Capture it.</em></h1><aside><p>Your patients are already searching for doctors, procedures and treatments. RM Search puts your clinic in front of that intent.</p><a href="/contact">Request a demand forecast ↗</a></aside></div></section>
<section class="signal"><div class="shell signal-grid"><span class="eyebrow">THE DIFFERENCE</span><h2>Meta interrupts.<br/>Search answers.</h2><p>Google Search starts with intent. A person has already described what they need. Our job is to understand that demand, win the right clicks and turn them into enquiries.</p></div></section>
<section class="forecast shell"><div class="forecast-head"><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE LAUNCH</span><h2>First, we look at<br/>the numbers.</h2></div><div class="calculator"><div><b>01</b><span>SEARCH DEMAND</span><strong>How many people<br/>are looking?</strong></div><i>→</i><div><b>02</b><span>CLICK ECONOMICS</span><strong>What does access<br/>to demand cost?</strong></div><i>→</i><div><b>03</b><span>ENQUIRY MODEL</span><strong>What could the<br/>budget produce?</strong></div></div><p class="note">A forecast is an estimate, not a promise. It gives us a commercial starting point before money is spent.</p></section>
<section class="intent"><div class="shell"><div class="intent-head"><span class="eyebrow">SEARCH INTENT</span><h2>Not every search<br/>deserves your budget.</h2></div><div class="query-list"><div><span>LOW INTENT</span><strong>“why does my tooth hurt”</strong><b>RESEARCH</b></div><div><span>MID INTENT</span><strong>“dental implant price”</strong><b>COMPARISON</b></div><div class="hot"><span>HIGH INTENT</span><strong>“dental implant clinic riga”</strong><b>PATIENT DEMAND</b></div></div></div></section>
<section class="system shell"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT WE BUILD</span><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Demand map</h3><p>Services, keywords, languages, locations and intent are mapped before campaign structure is built.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Search campaigns</h3><p>Budget is separated around real service demand instead of being mixed into one generic campaign.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Landing relevance</h3><p>The ad and landing page answer the same patient need. Less friction, clearer next step.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Conversion tracking</h3><p>Calls and forms matter more than traffic. Optimisation is built around measurable enquiries.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="proof"><div class="shell proof-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">REAL WORK / GOOGLE ADS</span><h2>Existing demand.<br/>Measured outcomes.</h2><a href="/cases">See Google Ads cases ↗</a></div><div class="metric"><strong>10,601</strong><span>DENTA · GOOGLE ADS CONVERSIONS<br/>2025</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>3,356</strong><span>CONSILIUM MEDICUM · CONVERSIONS<br/>2024</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>€3.25</strong><span>CONSILIUM MEDICUM<br/>COST / CONVERSION · 2024</span></div></div></section>
<section class="limits"><div class="shell limits-grid"><span class="eyebrow">MEDICAL SEARCH</span><h2>Healthcare is not<br/>ordinary advertising.</h2><p>Medical campaigns face policy restrictions, sensitive categories and recurring limitations. We build within those constraints instead of pretending they do not exist.</p></div></section>
<section class="cta shell"><span class="eyebrow">RM SEARCH</span><h2>How much patient demand already exists in your market?</h2><p>Tell us the clinic, location and services you want to promote. We'll assess the search opportunity before discussing launch.</p><a href="/contact">Request a demand forecast ↗</a></section>
<section class="related shell"><div class="related-head"><span class="eyebrow">RELATED CASES / GOOGLE ADS</span><h2>See how search demand turns into clinic enquiries.</h2></div><div class="case-cards"><a href="/cases/denta/google-ads"><span class="eyebrow">DENTA / GOOGLE ADS</span><h3>Scale high-intent dental search without losing CPA control.</h3><strong>10,601</strong><p>conversions · 2025</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/consilium-medicum/google-ads"><span class="eyebrow">CONSILIUM / GOOGLE ADS</span><h3>Capture medical demand under strict advertising rules.</h3><strong>3,356</strong><p>conversions · 2024</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/epiline/google-ads"><span class="eyebrow">EPILINE / GOOGLE ADS</span><h3>Turn treatment searches into measurable enquiries.</h3><strong>1,343</strong><p>conversions · Jan–Aug 2026</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/union-klinika/google-ads"><span class="eyebrow">UNION KLINIKA / GOOGLE ADS</span><h3>Capture patients already close to choosing a clinic.</h3><strong>SEARCH</strong><p>high-intent patient acquisition</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a></div></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{padding:38px 0 120px;min-height:780px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:15px}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.55fr .45fr;gap:70px;align-items:end;margin-top:100px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(72px,10.5vw,160px);line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:0;font-weight:650}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}.hero aside{padding-bottom:12px}.hero aside p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 45px}.hero aside a,.cta a{display:inline-block;background:var(--ink);color:white;padding:18px 22px;font-weight:650}.signal{background:var(--accent);padding:110px 0}.signal-grid,.limits-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.45fr 1fr .65fr;gap:55px}.signal h2,.limits h2{font-size:clamp(50px,6vw,90px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:0}.signal p,.limits p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin:0}.forecast{padding:130px 0}.forecast-head,.intent-head,.related-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.45fr 1.55fr;gap:50px}.forecast h2,.intent h2,.related h2{font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,86px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:0}.calculator{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;margin-top:80px;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}.calculator>div{min-height:290px;padding:25px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.calculator b{font:11px monospace}.calculator span{font:10px monospace;color:var(--muted);margin-top:auto}.calculator strong{font-size:27px;line-height:1.05;margin-top:12px}.calculator>i{font-size:40px;font-style:normal}.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);max-width:560px;margin:25px 0 0}.intent{background:var(--dark);color:white;padding:120px 0}.query-list{margin-top:70px}.query-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.35fr 1fr .3fr;align-items:center;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #333}.query-list span,.query-list b{font:10px monospace;color:#777}.query-list strong{font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,44px);font-weight:500}.query-list b{text-align:right}.query-list .hot{color:#fff}.query-list .hot span,.query-list .hot b{color:var(--accent)}.system{padding:140px 0}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-top:45px;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}.steps>div{padding:25px 30px 70px 0}.steps>div+div{padding-left:30px;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}.steps b{font:11px monospace}.steps h3{font-size:27px;margin:70px 0 15px}.steps p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;font-size:14px}.proof{background:#e1e0da;padding:120px 0}.proof-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr repeat(3,.7fr)}.proof-grid>div{padding:25px;border-left:1px solid #bbb}.proof-grid>div:first-child{border-left:0}.proof h2{font-size:40px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:480px;margin:45px 0}.proof a{font-size:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}.metric{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:330px}.metric strong{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,76px);letter-spacing:-.065em}.metric span{font:10px monospace;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}.limits{padding:120px 0;background:var(--accent)}.cta{padding:150px 0}.cta h2{font-size:clamp(60px,8vw,118px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.065em;max-width:1250px;margin:30px 0}.cta p{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:650px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:40px}.related{padding:40px 0 140px}.related-head{border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-top:30px}.case-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:60px}.case-cards a{min-height:390px;background:#e4e3dd;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform .2s ease}.case-cards a:nth-child(2){background:var(--dark);color:white}.case-cards a:nth-child(3){background:var(--accent)}.case-cards a:nth-child(4){background:#d7d6cf}.case-cards a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}.case-cards h3{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,48px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:55px 0 30px}.case-cards strong{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,78px);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin-top:auto}.case-cards p,.case-cards b{font:10px monospace}.case-cards p{opacity:.62;margin:8px 0 28px}@media(max-width:850px){.hero-grid,.signal-grid,.limits-grid,.forecast-head,.intent-head,.related-head,.proof-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{min-height:auto}.calculator{grid-template-columns:1fr}.calculator>i{transform:rotate(90deg);justify-self:center}.query-list>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.query-list b{text-align:left}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps>div+div{padding-left:0;border-left:0}.proof-grid>div{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #bbb}.metric{min-height:220px}.case-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>